OL,3,ABurnham and Badenoch clash on welfare
OL,4,Abill and youth unemployment at PMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham argues the government is giving
OL,7,F"hope to young people", and that the
OL,8,Fbiggest rise in Neets - people aged 16
OL,9,Fto 24 not in employment, education or
OL,10,Ftraining - came under the Conservatives
OL,12,FBurnham began the session with a joke
OL,13,Fabout ChatGPT, after a report suggested
OL,14,Fone of his speechwriters used the tool
OL,15,F- watch the moment here
